<title>AUSTRALIA: CBA three-year bond priced at 22 bp over.</title>
<headline>CBA three-year bond priced at 22 bp over.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commonwealth Bank of Australia's (CBA) said on Thursday its A$400 million three-year domestic bond issue has been priced at 22 basis points over Australian government bonds for a reoffer yield of 6.955 percent.</p>
<p>The bonds carry a coupon of 6-3/4 percent and mature on April 15, 2000.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
